  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neighbourhood Partnership with Tunisia 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neighbourhood Partnership with Tunisia 2022-2025. The program has three main focus areas; (1) human rights, including capacity building in the government sector, (2) equality and human dignity; including combating violence against women/domestic violence, and preventing children from exploitation, (3) guaranteeing social rights through promoting the rule of law, and securing independent institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
